Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ack! Ack!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.18,0:00:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ack!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.06,0:00:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.92,0:00:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he's sleeping in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We have an escaped inmate!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunt's out, use this kid,\Nand capture him! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ack! Ack!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.22,0:00:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ack!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.13,0:00:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want it, gotta go over the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.18,0:01:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.06,0:01:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.42,0:01:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,no Cause I'm aiming to get there\Nfirst, yeah It's all or nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,no time to worry Do it later,\Nright now I'm living free
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.32,0:01:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you It
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.30,0:01:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.16,0:01:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is\Nnot an option Once they're
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.32,0:01:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,close to feel the satisfaction\NYou think I'm rude,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.80,0:01:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,here's my appreciation When things\Nare getting tough, just gotta smile
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.78,0:01:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way\NAnd you're looking for a fresh,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,brand new day Then make sure your\Nonly thought you have is Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.30,0:01:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.82,0:01:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way,\Nmaps will be made. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.24,0:01:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,with every step that you will take
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.94,0:01:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've\Nbeen through Look ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,at new horizons In view\Nshining brightly Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.56,0:02:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,who knows what's waiting for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.82,0:02:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way\NMake like a hurricane Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.40,0:02:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,got to make your mark today
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.06,0:02:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.42,0:02:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,one wish Your dreams don't run away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout Over the top
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.76,0:02:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Reliquity lost that round, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And Mama as well She could be\Nanywhere after falling like that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.92,0:02:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try climbing the waterfall\NHe will just kick us down again
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.88,0:02:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That was one hell of a tumble I\Ncan't believe we survived without
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.12,0:02:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A scratch. It's a miracle that\NChanta landed right side off. So,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.68,0:02:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,we're just supposed to wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If any of us power users fall off the\Nship, we'll be as good as dead. Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that's what happened to Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.22,0:03:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I checked Mama's Vivre card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it says she's\Nstill among the lickety living.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.22,0:03:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So she didn't drown?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.32,0:03:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.28,0:03:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's just water down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.87,0:03:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That probably means the\NBeast Pirates hauled her
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.04,0:03:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,up from the sea and\Nlocked her away somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That complicates things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think they'll do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom and Kaido were\Ncrewmates many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.84,0:03:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But since they're both emperors now, they're\Nonly interested in coming out on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, they'll kill her for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.04,0:03:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.95,0:03:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what's gonna happen to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.08,0:03:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The era of the Big Mom Pirates will end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Because they'll become the Pharaoh\NSparrow Pirates, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.92,0:03:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, is that some kind of choke?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the next captain\Nshould obviously be Katakuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.38,0:03:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But our crew values seniority.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.72,0:03:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Quality is what we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.66,0:03:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The eldest son should be the\Nlickety-leader, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.58,0:04:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama won't die so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not some mere commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.62,0:04:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is Big Mom? A friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.10,0:04:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a strong lady from overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.98,0:04:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma-ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This shark-a-dile is so tame and\Nsweet, it even lets us run on its back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, after you pounded\Nit on the head twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.02,0:04:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, but why are you going\Ninto Udon with this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.06,0:04:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing you're saying\Nmakes a bit of sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you she's real strong,\Nso she'll help us save Big Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is making my head spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.90,0:04:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just come back for now, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.38,0:04:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can work all of this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.48,0:04:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Kin'emon has left me with a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.66,0:04:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I was to guard Lord Momonosuke in his\Nabsence, as if my life depended on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.98,0:04:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.26,0:04:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.74,0:04:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,On my honor as a kuno lichi, I vow that\Nno harm will come to the young lord! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:04:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You've barely even started your training!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.18,0:05:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even protect yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.98,0:05:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop being ridiculous and return home before\Nsomething bad happens to you yet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.68,0:05:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Hitetsu, I'm afraid\Nwe're already on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.02,0:05:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, turn back! I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.60,0:05:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Be reasonable, Lady Kiku! Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.24,0:05:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and see you for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.20,0:05:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye! Da-lick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.38,0:05:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something you just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The name Big Mom sounds\Nawfully familiar to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind, Olin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends were so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.26,0:05:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I had fun in Okobore town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.24,0:05:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all so generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.82,0:05:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.72,0:05:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.54,0:05:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but they welcomed me like a guest and\Neven gave me a sweet treat to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.78,0:05:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Her talking hat hasn't said a single word.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.54,0:05:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean it's lost its memory, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.76,0:05:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all coming back to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The flavor of that sweet\Nsoup melting in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:05:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.62,0:06:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help it, Topper-A-Bon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.80,0:06:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so cute and sweet,\NI could just eat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you! I'm not food!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.12,0:06:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're working hard, Momo. I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I must stay sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.54,0:06:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I am at the center of\Nthis conflict, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.38,0:06:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsunachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.40,0:06:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Most inconsiderate of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.90,0:06:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what's that thing you\Nsay when you swing your sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsunachi or something, it sounds like?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.50,0:06:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.64,0:06:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a word that fills you with energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.46,0:06:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsunachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.48,0:06:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.39,0:06:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm totally full of energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.88,0:06:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then say it with me! Snack! Snack! Snack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.34,0:06:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite enough, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.96,0:06:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.12,0:06:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you learn such a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.26,0:06:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what they yell in\Nsword fights overseas!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.86,0:06:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro taught it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He says it's a good luck word to uplift\Nyour spirit when your courage falters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.94,0:07:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I forbid you to\Nsay it. What? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's merely a coincidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but the same word was once\Nused in an old Kuri dialect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not appropriate for a\Nperson of your standing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.92,0:07:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What harm does it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.66,0:07:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But it gives you energy,\Nand I think it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.92,0:07:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid no means no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm positively famished.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me we've made it\Nto Udon and I can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.06,0:07:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I could really use a snack, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't drool and talk about\Nsnacks when you look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I'm afraid we\Nstill have quite a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.52,0:07:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, surely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.34,0:07:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you a rough\Nmap of the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.06,0:07:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, we have six regions, each\Nwith a different climate than the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They're divided by a river that\Nstretches across the entire island.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.40,0:08:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Colored rice, a secret message\Nfrom Shinobu, no doubt. Wait at the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,dried up well that seems convenient
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.52,0:08:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough. I am relieved to find
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.36,0:08:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you in good health though your\Npursuers must have been persistent
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.22,0:08:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,indeed if you fled all the way\Nhere to ringo but rest assured
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.06,0:08:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi's men will not follow\Nthis far. I'm still shocked that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.44,0:08:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,they would kill Komurasaki she\Nwas quite beloved yes the incident
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.20,0:08:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,has thrown the flower capital\Ninto an uproar it's sick she
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.02,0:08:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,wasn't a threat to anyone But the\Nsecond she stood up to Orochi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,they cut her right down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.72,0:08:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Samurai, you're scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The man who killed her is a Yakuza boss\Nknown as Napping Kyoshiro. Kyoshiro?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.66,0:08:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The name is not familiar to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.14,0:08:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,though I am quite familiar with the most\Nfamous Yakuza boss from 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.48,0:09:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He was called Hyogoro the Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.34,0:09:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A rather extravagant name, but I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Times have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.68,0:09:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyogoro was a man of\Nhonor who helped the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.64,0:09:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He would never have\Ndone such a cruel thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.16,0:09:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A shame he wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like this Kyoshiro fellow\Nis quite the loathsome beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, perhaps we shouldn't have\Ntaken Otoko back to his pleasure hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.08,0:09:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely what he did was\Njust a show of loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.96,0:09:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You think he would go\Nout of his way to kill
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,a child over a minor infraction like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he killed the Oiron who worked\Nfor him, and she was a superstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It worries me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We should check on her. Let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.26,0:09:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't catch a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.64,0:09:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.96,0:09:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.56,0:09:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're headed back to the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.42,0:09:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,let's have a nice warm soak in one of\Ntheir bathhouses to rest our weary bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.60,0:09:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:09:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait. I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.52,0:10:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be a nice change of pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.36,0:10:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need disguises.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.76,0:10:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,disguises.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.67,0:10:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi controls every\Naspect of the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.74,0:10:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, that applies to bathwater
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.38,0:10:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,just as well as drinking water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.04,0:10:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,One question first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Robi, perchance were you able to collect
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.36,0:10:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,any valuable information?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.50,0:10:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I'll share my meager scraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.88,0:10:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what time Orochi will\Nwake up on the day of the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.86,0:10:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what offerings they will\Ntake with them to Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.30,0:10:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Kaido's favorite food\Nand his crew's hierarchy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.46,0:10:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and the number of soldiers and weapons\Nthat that's meager by the way i happened
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.40,0:10:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,upon a poneglyph alas it wasn't a red\None though really you're two for two on
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.60,0:10:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,finding those bonkichi it was in a basement\Nroom with a reinforced door an odd place
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,full of wooden dolls there should be a\Nroad poneglyph here but if it's not in the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.52,0:10:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.43,0:10:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We can assume it's on Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido's Island, huh? Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.86,0:11:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We've acquired a treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Traffy of information.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The mission was a resounding success.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.84,0:11:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.32,0:11:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,To have such reliable
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.72,0:11:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,allies is truly a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.68,0:11:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Since all that's settled, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.24,0:11:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have a nice healing bath and also
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.98,0:11:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,see some panties, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.64,0:11:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll stand out and\Nyou're a pervert. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.32,0:11:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking news.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's favorite Oiran, Omasa, met a\Nterrible fate at the Shogun's Banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a big disagreement,\Nand Kyoshiro cut her right down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.54,0:11:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.45,0:11:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Find out more right here. Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.78,0:11:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Omasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.78,0:11:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you're\Nbeing a bit dramatic?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You only saw her once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world should\Nmourn the death of a beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.16,0:11:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.16,0:11:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems the funeral's tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.84,0:11:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're heartless, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.58,0:12:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My raid suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.34,0:12:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,think Odobi and the\Nothers got caught, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.46,0:12:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.44,0:12:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I should try to contact
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.72,0:12:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,them by smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.84,0:12:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where to use this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.94,0:12:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go to the women's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.50,0:12:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.41,0:12:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.33,0:12:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.24,0:12:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So much skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, whatever Usopp just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Hey, Traffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.72,0:12:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything about Udon in the paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.92,0:12:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,About Luffy Taro, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.78,0:12:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If he hasn't gone on a rampage\Nyet, it's only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.06,0:12:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't wait to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No article on Straw Hat, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.14,0:12:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Eustass, that dirty rat is here? Dirty?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.00,0:12:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he sneaking to the bath before me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.56,0:12:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know he was in 102.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.10,0:12:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,too he's been working with hawkins so\Nwhen i saw him i should have guessed
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.76,0:12:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,his partner would be here as well\Nor ex-partner since it says here he
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.40,0:13:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,escaped from the prison in udon it's\Njust him though so luffy is still
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,locked up yeah and this is going to\Nmake it even harder for him to break out
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,okay but you think they have nice\Nbath houses there shut up enough
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,About that, you're not listening at\Nall, are you? Wait, guys, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.54,0:13:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.84,0:13:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,worried my crew went
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.90,0:13:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,scouting but they haven't come
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,back yet we've had enough trouble\Ncan't something go right for once
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that, hey punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.52,0:13:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,listen up i got a question for you yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.80,0:13:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,what as i'm sure you've\Nheard Eustass kid has
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.24,0:13:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,escaped i'm willing to\Nbet you know something
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.72,0:14:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,about that maybe you even helped him huh
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.24,0:14:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.46,0:14:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is truly a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.72,0:14:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't eaten this much in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.64,0:14:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm overwhelmed with gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I eat this food with a grateful\Nstomach and a heart full of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.78,0:14:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.24,0:14:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to share some of those with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.12,0:14:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're having\Na feast over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.24,0:14:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You sticking up for your pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of a coincidence that Kid\Ndisappears right after you got sent here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you chatting it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We all did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.20,0:14:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really grossing me out. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.12,0:14:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, learn to deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.06,0:14:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because as long as you've got those\Ncuffs on, you ain't doing crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.36,0:14:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nbefore your pal gets caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.90,0:15:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,As it turns out, he didn't think\Nthings through before he bailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.60,0:15:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That is to say, he still has the\NC-prism stone cuffs on. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.68,0:15:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll round him up in no\Ntime and make him p-p-p-pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.78,0:15:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, your spit\Nstinks! Cut it out! Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.14,0:15:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just sounds like you're\Npicking a fight with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.76,0:15:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, how about I go over the rules again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.68,0:15:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first offense, both\Nyour arms will be cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.70,0:15:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,For the second offense,\Nwe chop off your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.80,0:15:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you're naughty a\Nthird time, then you'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.77,0:15:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So mind your manners, cuz if you screw\Nwith me, you're dead, dead, dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.44,0:15:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just a poor old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.24,0:15:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.76,0:15:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you hard-working individuals\Nwouldn't tolerate a cheater like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Rules are rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.42,0:15:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone can't follow them, then\Nthey forfeit their right to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Only fair, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.58,0:15:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't work, then you should\Nstep aside and starve to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.52,0:16:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the polite thing\Nto do, you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.06,0:16:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So stop being rude, old man. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.10,0:16:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you trying to crawl away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.46,0:16:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.37,0:16:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even stand up straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.14,0:16:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So how the hell did you\Nget all these food tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who gave them to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you steal them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.32,0:16:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My dumplings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My precious dumplings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.64,0:16:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Greedy old piece of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.92,0:16:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, they're so delicious\Nyou're stuffing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.82,0:16:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,in your mouth aren't you\Nyou have no right to eat
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.44,0:16:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,anything do you hear me\Nyou fart if you didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,earn a damn bite spit\Nthem out spit them out you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.14,0:16:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never spit them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.68,0:16:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,These were a gift from my\Nsavior, Mr. Straw Hatman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never, ever let them go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.88,0:17:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let that be a lesson to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.42,0:17:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.28,0:17:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And the same will happen to you\Nif you don't fix that attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.62,0:17:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.50,0:17:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.32,0:17:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The dumplings and the name of the\Nidiot who gave you those tickets!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.76,0:17:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I ate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.64,0:17:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're trying to piss me off,\Nthen you've done a fine job, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.00,0:17:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Who gave you the food tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.14,0:17:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's breaking the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just some punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.70,0:17:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But the person who gave me\Nthose tickets is a man of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.64,0:17:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He protects the weak from the mighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.00,0:18:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I must meet that chivalry with my\Nown, lest I be disgraced before him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.68,0:18:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Meeting a man like that\Nmade me think of Bygondes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, they called\Nme Hyogoro the Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.72,0:18:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,After so long, my stomach is full\Nand my heart is filled with joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.84,0:18:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a land of samurai. There\Nused to be a bunch of men like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Rich in courage and pride
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.18,0:18:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And then you bastards killed them all
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lufitaro, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.46,0:18:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough of you\Nfor a lifetime. You know
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.48,0:19:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,what happens when you\Ntalk back to the guards?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.34,0:19:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then kill me, you damn thug!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.56,0:19:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to try that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.98,0:19:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I said you're a damn thug, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,All you know is violence, you\Ndon't have an ounce of pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.50,0:19:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what you wanted to hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.54,0:19:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.88,0:19:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you conquered us because we lost our\Nspines and forgot what we were made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.76,0:19:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, old man, have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.46,0:19:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll smash your skull, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.56,0:19:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.80,0:19:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't hit a guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.20,0:19:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna execute you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.12,0:19:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Tyro! Hey! Hold that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.38,0:19:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stay back! You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.58,0:19:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.44,0:20:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It, please stop. I've
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.98,0:20:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,had enough I'm all spent I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.00,0:20:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,General type. Whoever attacks one\Nof the guards will be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.70,0:20:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.61,0:20:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And we all saw it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.24,0:20:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't talk your way out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.92,0:20:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.08,0:20:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No more mercy. Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,General Solitaire, the keys have been
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.24,0:20:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,stolen. Monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.64,0:20:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone made off with the keys\Nto the C-PRISM stone cuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, you fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.90,0:20:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did anyone see who did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.48,0:21:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, it was some guy\Nwith a freakishly huge head!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.34,0:21:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me I dropped the key that\Nhad me replace it with a fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.36,0:21:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.02,0:21:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a thick shell, but he\Ntaunted me about walking sideways!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.50,0:21:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't even try to butter me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.64,0:21:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.30,0:21:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I ought to make you into a bisque!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.66,0:21:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be in the tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Search high and low in the attic too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.32,0:21:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have fulfilled my duty\Nas a ninja splendidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I must simply deliver the\Nkeys. Onward! He's here. Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.32,0:21:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A mirage?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.70,0:21:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a shooter!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.76,0:21:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I could have finished sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.32,0:21:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon the wait, Sir\NLuffyTaro, but I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.06,0:21:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your freedom is close at hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.10,0:21:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, a stealthy departure. Beep!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.88,0:22:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Master Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.94,0:22:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.48,0:22:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Elite Performer has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.42,0:22:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.66,0:22:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him, kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.60,0:24:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.63,0:24:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.45,0:24:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.80,0:24:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him! Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.71,0:24:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.63,0:24:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him! Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.54,0:25:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.06,0:25:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him! Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.97,0:25:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.88,0:25:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.80,0:25:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't over!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.71,0:25:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll both be free!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.62,0:25:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't resist!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.54,0:25:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.45,0:25:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't win with those cuffs on anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.36,0:25:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Might as well make it quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.28,0:25:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to fight, then fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.19,0:25:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.10,0:25:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on with that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.01,0:25:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he able to fight\Nlike that with the cuffs on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.93,0:25:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We followed regulations,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.84,0:25:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,so just like all the\Nother powered prisoners,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.75,0:25:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,he should be just strong enough to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.67,0:25:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's to say, he's only about\Nas tough as a regular schmuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.58,0:25:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying I'm weaker than\Na regular schmuck? No, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.49,0:25:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.41,0:25:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's running out of breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.32,0:25:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.23,0:25:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sea Prism Stone is doing its job.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.14,0:25:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But the man has resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.06,0:25:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pushing through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.97,0:25:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the warden here,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.88,0:25:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and I don't like having you violate\Nthe laws of physics in my prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.80,0:25:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This place has been great training for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.71,0:25:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,By the time I get these things off, I\Nknow I'm going to be stronger than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.62,0:25:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're working hard for the future,\Nbut in reality, you have none!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.54,0:25:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I could use a good\Nsparring partner, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.45,0:25:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.36,0:25:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're rather cocky, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.27,0:25:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, this'll put you in your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.80,0:26:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Elephant Smart Chew, now sneeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.86,0:26:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks bad, Mr. Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.86,0:26:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.80,0:26:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, he's strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.70,0:26:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.60,0:26:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Babanuki, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.06,0:26:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Queen arrived a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.40,0:26:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.20,0:26:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.46,0:26:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.58,0:26:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If Queen already started his show\Nand I'd get there late, you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.04,0:26:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.86,0:27:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even use my Haki!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.82,0:27:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my sweet Komurasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.84,0:27:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.46,0:27:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting pumped!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.62,0:27:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too good for our cheap, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.02,0:27:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so we miss Combo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.72,0:27:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, it's showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.56,0:27:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll stop by the brothel once\NI'm done here. Roger, Zach!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.74,0:27:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think we should tell\Nhim that Combo Rosaki's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.84,0:27:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll kill us for sure, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.44,0:27:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let someone else do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.76,0:28:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to party!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.60,0:28:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not gonna lose no weight,\Njust more to appreciate.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.30,0:28:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I got enough fans attracted to my farm!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.28,0:28:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I look round as a ball, but\Nall of this is muscle, y 'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.20,0:28:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,These Bombs moves of\Nmine are powered by my...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.08,0:28:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting,\Nyou pieces of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.62,0:28:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Climb up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.53,0:28:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.42,0:29:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, lay it on me one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.04,0:29:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's got to be in your bonnet today?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.80,0:29:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Baba Nuki's top three pains in my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.16,0:29:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.08,0:29:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Number three.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.60,0:29:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Eustass Kidd has escaped from the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.98,0:29:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaaaat?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.32,0:29:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.50,0:29:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.41,0:29:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The keys to the sea prism stone\Nhandcuffs have been stolen!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.04,0:29:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaaaaaaaat?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.30,0:29:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.42,0:29:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Emmy number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.02,0:29:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy's running wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.12,0:29:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.32,0:29:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaaaaaaaat?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.60,0:29:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then chase him!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.52,0:29:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.18,0:29:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.26,0:29:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry a bit, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.56,0:29:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This house is empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.00,0:29:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're free to use it as much as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.06,0:30:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're pals with Zoro Juro, then that\Nmakes the two of you A-OK in my book.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.34,0:30:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.72,0:30:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's hardly worth thanking me for.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.66,0:30:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Empty houses are opening up left and right,\Nbecause people keep starving to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.50,0:30:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You fellas sure are lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.70,0:30:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not seeing the joke here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.56,0:30:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he just likes to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.50,0:30:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, when you're this hungry,\Nyou either laugh or you cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.98,0:30:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, bad timing, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.10,0:30:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You just missed Zorojuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.00,0:30:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, can you tell us\Nwhere he went? Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.10,0:30:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He dashed out the door before\NI could ask where he was going.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.38,0:30:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Said his sword was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.02,0:30:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have seen his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.64,0:30:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows how far the\Npoor man's gone by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.50,0:30:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he did get his sword,\Nhe'll never find his way back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.20,0:30:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.80,0:30:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, shouldn't Blackleg\Nbe with us right now, too? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.34,0:30:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.06,0:30:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.78,0:30:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly where to use this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.00,0:31:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go to the women's bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.78,0:31:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.66,0:31:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but you think they\Nhave nice bathhouses there?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.68,0:31:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.56,0:31:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.12,0:31:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is what baths are like\Nhere, huh? The water is a bit
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.92,0:31:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,too hot for my taste though people\Naround here like to show off
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.54,0:31:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm sure they keep it this\Nhot just so they can say is it
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.38,0:31:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,chilly in here today guess there\Nare lots of things about this
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.66,0:31:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,place i don't get is it too hot\Nfor you to get in it's not so
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.16,0:31:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,bad after a while it would leave\Nme feeling a bit defenseless
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.14,0:31:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm afraid what if an enemy\Nshowed up as cautious as a ninja
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.54,0:31:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A fine trait to have. Since\NOra-B and I are both magic users,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.08,0:31:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,it's only natural that we're\Nwary when we take a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.94,0:32:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.54,0:32:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.42,0:32:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Her enemies might not\Nbother me, but they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.36,0:32:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I charge a viewing fee?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.88,0:32:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.12,0:32:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A mixed bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.46,0:32:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You sound awfully surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.46,0:32:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think anything of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.62,0:32:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but perhaps mixed baths are\Nuncommon where you're from?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.26,0:32:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you'll get used to it
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.24,0:32:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Naughty boys gawking at you\Nis nothing unusual in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.80,0:32:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I can blame them.\NIt's only natural they'd want
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.50,0:32:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,a little peek at this Eat\Nyour hearts out gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.22,0:32:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to be shy
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.82,0:32:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,NINPO BALL CRUSHER!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.38,0:33:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph, let's move on to the washing area.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.08,0:33:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,After we've warmed up in the bath, we\Nhelp Sansake wash our bags. Sansake?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.18,0:33:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.88,0:33:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Sansake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.22,0:33:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,that title we give to the experts\Nwho scrub our backs at the bathhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.06,0:33:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why an octopus, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.90,0:33:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Since he has eight limbs, that\Nmakes him a real pro with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.84,0:33:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty handy, right? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.94,0:33:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoshiro creeps me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.64,0:33:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get inside his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.72,0:33:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you can't trust the Yakuza.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.70,0:33:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking\Nabout, you young folks?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.68,0:33:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yakuza in this country\Nare allies to the common man!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.04,0:33:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Or they were back in my day, anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.86,0:33:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Their old boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.30,0:33:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a great man named\NHyogoro, the Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.98,0:33:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the person Kanjuro\Nwas talking about before?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.96,0:34:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I am quite familiar with the most\Nfamous Yakuza boss from 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.82,0:34:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He was called Hyogoro, the Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.10,0:34:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyogoro was indeed a man\Nof courage and honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.82,0:34:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish he was with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.10,0:34:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The samurai would heed his call.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.58,0:34:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.74,0:34:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I doubt we'll be able\Nto recruit 5,000 troops without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.74,0:34:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,500 may be the best we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.88,0:34:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.79,0:34:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like he was something else. Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.04,0:34:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,20 years ago, he was the most\Ninfluential man in the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.02,0:34:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He was always pulling strings behind\Nthe scenes in the flower capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.28,0:34:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He won the respect of\Nthe Yakuza bosses in all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.32,0:34:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the other regions of the\Nland of Wano as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.64,0:34:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Known for his chivalry and charisma,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.02,0:34:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,he would protect those in\Nneed when the law could not
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.80,0:34:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He was strong too,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.50,0:34:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,that was why even Lord\NOdin looked up to him So
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.34,0:34:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,is there a reason why we\Ncan't recruit this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.88,0:34:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.79,0:35:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,it's been over 20 years since he was in\Ncharge These days, no one knows where he is
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.30,0:35:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Most believe that he was killed by\NOrochi when he refused to serve his clan
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.42,0:35:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Fukuro Kuju,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.62,0:35:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the leader of the Oniwabanshu,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.32,0:35:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,once supported the Kozuki\Nclan alongside Hyogoro,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.12,0:35:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but he decided to take\Nthe opposite path from
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.20,0:35:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyogoro and pledge his\Nloyalty to Orochi these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.34,0:35:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I worked for him when he first changed\Nsides, but I couldn't take it and ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.38,0:35:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,From that day forward,\NI became their enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.94,0:35:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.78,0:35:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's you, Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.66,0:35:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still alive, you bewitching vixen!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.26,0:35:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You seductress kunoichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.50,0:35:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why that ninja knew you,\Nhuh? How cool! You're famous!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.00,0:35:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.16,0:35:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a shame, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.50,0:35:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss Yoguro, but he's nothing\Nmore than a piece of history now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.48,0:36:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times are you going\Nto make me say it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.88,0:36:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just join our crew and Kaido\Nwill pardon you for your crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.40,0:36:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you're not going to\Nget a better deal than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.40,0:36:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.88,0:36:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is truly unfortunate timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.32,0:36:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Luffy, I have the key you need...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.20,0:36:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet this looks real familiar, Hyogoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.74,0:36:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If I recall, Kaido and Orochi wanted you\Non their side pretty badly back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.84,0:36:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, the big fancy Yakuza boss is\Nnothing but a malnourished old fart.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.56,0:36:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you'd wish you'd taken\Nthat offer back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.32,0:36:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, did he say Hyogoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.76,0:36:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But that old man's so tiny, you\Ncould pick him up with one hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.12,0:36:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My days are past.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.00,0:36:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But please don't let Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.84,0:36:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat end up like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.26,0:36:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Have mercy, I
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.76,0:37:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,beg of you what
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.82,0:37:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,to do oh wait a sec I got
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.34,0:37:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,an idea this is gonna be\Nwild what should I do I can
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.86,0:37:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,scarcely believe it you haven't\Nchanged a bit since I last
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.20,0:37:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,saw you who is it who gazes\Nfrom the darkness it is I old
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.28,0:37:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.19,0:37:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What of Lord Momonosuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.16,0:37:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he live?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.07,0:37:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.12,0:37:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.08,0:37:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu?
